<title>USA: First Data pre-paid Shell card pilot.</title>
<headline>First Data pre-paid Shell card pilot.</headline>
<dateline>SUNRISE, Fla. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Data Corp said on Thursday that two of its business units will support a pilot program for pre-paid cards recently introduced by Shell Oil Products Co using First Data's PetroCash platform.</p>
<p>The pilot program for the Shell Transport and Trading Co Plc /Royal Dutch Petroleum Co unit will give consumers the ability to purchase gasoline and other merchandise at participating Shell stations in two test markets, First Data said.</p>
<p>Shell Oil is the largest gasoline retailer in the United States with more than 8,900 Shell stations nationwide.</p>
</text>
